<h2 id="how-we-work">How this site works</h2>
<p>8PayCommission is an independent publisher. We read official notifications, Cabinet statements and Parliament replies, and cite the date of each fact. When something is a forecast, we label it as one. Calculators run in your browser and do not send your pay details anywhere. Read our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> to see how we handle sources and corrections.</p>
